OL,3,GNEWSARecord sightings of rare moth in
OL,4,AGlen Affric
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of sightings have been
OL,7,Fmade of a moth that is found almost
OL,8,Fexclusively in Glen Affric in the
OL,9,FHighlands.
OL,11,FThe Affric Twitcher, also known by its
OL,12,Fscientific name Choreutis diana, is one
OL,13,Fof the UK's rarest species of moth.
OL,15,FA local recorder, Mike Taylor, saw 43
OL,16,Fadult moths during a two-day visit to
OL,17,Fthe glen - the highest number for the
OL,18,Farea since records began in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
